{
    "title": "Soul Quest: Epic War RPG",
    "description": "<b>Embark on an epic journey as a powerful wizard through the age of war and magic survival in Soul Quest: Epic War RPG.</b> \r\n\r\nFrom ancient to modern times, you will command an army of mini warriors, masters in the art of war across historical epochs. Your quest in Soul Quest: Epic War RPG begins with collecting souls from defeated enemies, empowering you to summon your own mini warriors. These summoned champions are your key to conquering relentless zombie waves and monstrous hordes that threaten to engulf each era of history!\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features:</b> \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc7b <b>Collect souls & resurrect warriors:</b> Gather souls from fallen foes to strengthen your soul knight army and unlock powerful summoning abilities.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <b>Master the Art of War:</b> Strategize and deploy your mini warriors strategically to defeat zombie waves and monstrous hordes. It's heroes vs hordes - using your army strategically will ensure your survival through the eras.\r\n\r\n\u2694\ufe0f <b>Engage in epic battles:</b> Engage in age of war from ancient civilizations to futuristic realms, all in the quest to conquer and survive io.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udddf <b>Heroes vs Hordes:</b> Lead your summoned warriors against hordes of zombies and monstrous creatures in intense, tactical battles. You can resurrect fallen warriors and distribute souls evenly among the units you've unlocked, ensuring a balanced and formidable army at all times.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddd9 <b>Wizardry and Magic survival:</b> You're a wizard with powerful abilities - harness the mystical forces of wizardry to augment your army\u2019s abilities and turn the tide of battle. Win magical artifacts to increase your chances of survival and show your full wizard powers!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0e <b>Strategic Conquest:</b> Plan your moves carefully as you navigate through the challenges of each age of war, mastering the art of war and survival io against overwhelming odds.\r\n\r\n<b>Join the Soul Quest in this Epic War RPG, harness the power of souls and summon your army of mini warriors in this survival io.</b>\r\nAs a wizard and soul knight collecting the dark souls of your defeated enemies, it's your mission to conquer this heroes vs hordes battle of the ages. Master the art of war, defeat the zombie waves, and ensure your survival io.\r\n\r\n<b>If you enjoy strategy, historical battles and zombie games, then Soul Quest: Epic War RPG is the war game for you.</b>\r\nWe are warriors fighting for survival through the eras, and you're the wizard in charge of leading us to victory. Are you up to the challenge?",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Embark on an epic journey as a powerful wizard through the age of war and magic survival in Soul Quest: Epic War RPG.</b> <br><br>From ancient to modern times, you will command an army of mini warriors, masters in the art of war across historical epochs. Your quest in Soul Quest: Epic War RPG begins with collecting souls from defeated enemies, empowering you to summon your own mini warriors. These summoned champions are your key to conquering relentless zombie waves and monstrous hordes that threaten to engulf each era of history!<br><br><b>Key Features:</b> <br><br>\ud83d\udc7b <b>Collect souls &amp; resurrect warriors:</b> Gather souls from fallen foes to strengthen your soul knight army and unlock powerful summoning abilities.<br><br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <b>Master the Art of War:</b> Strategize and deploy your mini warriors strategically to defeat zombie waves and monstrous hordes. It&#39;s heroes vs hordes - using your army strategically will ensure your survival through the eras.<br><br>\u2694\ufe0f <b>Engage in epic battles:</b> Engage in age of war from ancient civilizations to futuristic realms, all in the quest to conquer and survive io.<br><br>\ud83e\udddf <b>Heroes vs Hordes:</b> Lead your summoned warriors against hordes of zombies and monstrous creatures in intense, tactical battles. You can resurrect fallen warriors and distribute souls evenly among the units you&#39;ve unlocked, ensuring a balanced and formidable army at all times.<br><br>\ud83e\uddd9 <b>Wizardry and Magic survival:</b> You&#39;re a wizard with powerful abilities - harness the mystical forces of wizardry to augment your army\u2019s abilities and turn the tide of battle. Win magical artifacts to increase your chances of survival and show your full wizard powers!<br><br>\ud83c\udf0e <b>Strategic Conquest:</b> Plan your moves carefully as you navigate through the challenges of each age of war, mastering the art of war and survival io against overwhelming odds.<br><br><b>Join the Soul Quest in this Epic War RPG, harness the power of souls and summon your army of mini warriors in this survival io.</b><br>As a wizard and soul knight collecting the dark souls of your defeated enemies, it&#39;s your mission to conquer this heroes vs hordes battle of the ages. Master the art of war, defeat the zombie waves, and ensure your survival io.<br><br><b>If you enjoy strategy, historical battles and zombie games, then Soul Quest: Epic War RPG is the war game for you.</b><br>We are warriors fighting for survival through the eras, and you&#39;re the wizard in charge of leading us to victory. Are you up to the challenge?",
